WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.094 --> 00:00:15.615
Cora watched the new cuttlefish swim by.

2
00:00:15.616 --> 00:00:20.707
"I'm Stan and I'm the best," he sang.

3
00:00:20.708 --> 00:00:25.932
"I hide better than the rest.

4
00:00:25.933 --> 00:00:30.260
I can win any contest."

5
00:00:30.261 --> 00:00:36.181
"Boy, he brags a lot," Mo said.

6
00:00:36.182 --> 00:00:40.876
Stan kept swimming and singing.

7
00:00:40.877 --> 00:00:46.396
"I can hide any time, any place!"

8
00:00:46.397 --> 00:00:51.337
He winked at other fish.

9
00:00:51.338 --> 00:00:56.534
Cora frowned. "Ugh! That's enough!"

10
00:00:56.535 --> 00:00:59.137
She swam right up to Stan.

11
00:00:59.138 --> 00:01:02.345
"You think you're so great!" she said.

12
00:01:02.346 --> 00:01:06.314
"Well, I'm a better hider than you."

13
00:01:06.315 --> 00:01:09.513
"Oh yeah?" Stan said.

14
00:01:09.514 --> 00:01:12.415
"Yeah!" Cora said.

15
00:01:12.416 --> 00:01:16.701
"Then how about a contest?" Stan said.

16
00:01:16.702 --> 00:01:20.518
"How about right now?" Cora said.

17
00:01:20.519 --> 00:01:27.063
"I'll be the judge!" said Mo.

18
00:01:27.064 --> 00:01:30.765
"Look, here's a pretty purple coral.

19
00:01:30.766 --> 00:01:34.500
Whoever hides in it the best wins."

20
00:01:34.501 --> 00:01:37.059
"Deal," Stan said.

21
00:01:37.060 --> 00:01:42.109
"Deal," Cora said.

22
00:01:42.110 --> 00:01:45.421
Cora got her tentacles ready to change color.

23
00:01:45.422 --> 00:01:48.600
Stan made light flicker across his back.

24
00:01:48.601 --> 00:01:51.205
"On your mark," Mo said.

25
00:01:51.206 --> 00:01:53.437
"Get set . . ."

26
00:01:53.438 --> 00:01:56.702
"Wait!" called a voice.

27
00:01:56.703 --> 00:02:00.284
Rita rushed toward them.

28
00:02:00.285 --> 00:02:04.635
"Shark alert! Shark alert!" she cried.

29
00:02:04.636 --> 00:02:09.914
"Two whitetip sharks are coming!"

